From 8d86babc92c3d451402c3d53418b40708025f3f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:33:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve variable syntax provenance and executed
 visit scope

Separate real shell syntax from conservative printed and quote payloads so redirect variables are not promoted to commands. Distinguish mention and execution visits so a quoted fragment cannot hide a sourced function library. Proof: 2327 lifecycle tests green; combined with PR3092 head 46bf033fe4a45af5ae3c84c02b5d4aef4fb0bce4, 362 tests pass including exact gh shim allow case and all function variable differentials. All 20 scripts/check gates pass.
---
 cron/lifecycle_guard.py                       | 14 +++++--
 cron/lifecycle_guard_nested_shells.py         |  7 +++-
 cron/lifecycle_guard_output.py                | 17 +++++---
 cron/lifecycle_guard_variables.py             | 17 +++++---
 ...test_lifecycle_guard_function_variables.py | 40 +++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

